  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5027687,
    "UIName": "Templar",
    "Id": "chassisdef_templar_TLR1-OU",
    "Name": "Templar",
    "Details": "This variant was originally designed for underwater operations, but has since been convert to land usage. In addition to four Jump Jets it is also equipped with a BattleMech HarJel System to repair hull breaches. Three Medium Pulse Lasers and a Large Pulse Laser provide energy weapon support. An SRM-6 and LRM-10 torpedo launcher increase the odds of breaching an enemy unit's armor. A C3 slave allows the Templar U to share targeting data with friendly units.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Templar"
  },
